                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">UPnPEventListener</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - 
UPnP Events are mapped and delivered to applications according to the OSGi
 whiteboard model.
   </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
