                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">IllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if the UPnP device has been removed from
         the network.</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
