                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 This method must continue to return the state variable minimum value
 after the UPnP state variable has been removed from the network.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
